---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import { business, socials, tagline } from '@/site';
---

<Base>
  <section class="flex flex-col items-center">
    <img
      src="/avatar-400.jpg"
      alt={business.founder}
      width="100"
      height="100"
      class="rounded-full w-[100px] h-[100px] object-cover"
    />
    <h1 class="mt-6 font-bold text-3xl font-serif text-center">
      {business.founder}
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-400 text-center">{tagline}</p>
    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      {
        socials.map(({ title, href, icon }) => (
          <a
            href={href}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label={title}
            title={title}
            class="size-6 text-neutral-400 transition-colors hover:text-white [&>svg]:size-full"
            set:html={icon}
          />
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-[520px] space-y-4 text-neutral-200 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I was a software engineer at Solana Labs. I built a payments product
        that processed over $100M through Shopify, and backend infrastructure
        for on-chain game studios. Before that, I triple majored in Math,
        Computer Science, and Statistics at Rutgers in 2.5 years.
      </p>
      <p>
        I was very fortunate early in my career, and by 22 I was able to
        semi-retire. Then I traveled the world. I learned Portuguese in 10
        days, surfed in Brazil, and sang my first song in Argentina. I went on
        expeditions to the Arctic and the Antarctic, explored India on my own,
        and meditated for 10 days without talking, three separate times.
      </p>
      <p>
        Now I'm about to turn 25, and no one ever told me what to do after the
        success. So I'm doing the only thing I can: trying to be a kid again.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-400">Say hi at {business.emailText}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
